  992                 /       CALL HANDLING CONTINUES HERE.
  993   
  994                 /       BY PASSING THE LOGICAL UNIT BIT DIRECTLY TO THIS PART OF THE ROM SETUP CODE,
  995                 /       THE RETRY COUNTER SUPPORT IS BYPASSED [ALLOWING THE RETRY COUNTER WORD TO BE
  996                 /       REPURPOSED].  [LOOK IN THE OS/8 HANDLER FOR HOW TO INTERACT WITH THE RETRY
  997                 /       COUNTER; THIS MAKES TAPE OPERATIONS LESS RELIABLE COMPARED TO P?S/8.]
