 1004                 /       0000 ARE LOADED INTO 07360-07557.  THE RECOVERY ROUTINE WILL HAVE TO RECREATE
 1005                 /       THE PROPER CONTENTS PRIOR TO MOVING THE ENTIRE PAGE CONTENTS FROM 07360-07557
 1006                 /       TO 07600-07777; THIS CAN BE AVOIDED BY ONE OF SEVERAL METHODS:
 1007   
 1008                 /       1)  REWORK THE CODE NORMALLY LOADED AT 07620 TO AVOID THE DESTRUCTION [AND
 1009                 /           HOPEFULLY NOT MERELY CAUSE SOME ALTERNATE DESTRUCTION].
 1010   
