 1035   007674* 6272  CIFR,   CIF     ROMFLD                  /GOING TO THE ROM FIELD.
 1036   007675* 5671          JMP I   WRQUAD                  /RETURN TO CALLER.
 1037   
 1038                 /       NOTE: THE PREVIOUS WORD IS SUBJECT TO DESTRUCTION WHEN THE CONTENTS OF BLOCK
 1039                 /       0000 ARE LOADED INTO 07360-07557.  THE RECOVERY ROUTINE WILL HAVE TO RECREATE
 1040                 /       THE PROPER CONTENTS PRIOR TO MOVING THE ENTIRE PAGE CONTENTS FROM 07360-07557
 1041                 /       TO 07600-07777; THIS CAN ONLY BE AVOIDED BY REWORKING THE CODE THAT STARTS UP
 1042                 /       AT 07400 [NORMALLY IN 07620 ONWARD] IF POSSIBLE.  WHILE THIS IS UNLIKELY, IT
 1043                 /       SHOULD BE POSSIBLE TO ALLOW THE RECOVERY ROUTINE TO FIT INTO THE ALLOTED CODE
 1044                 /       SPACE AND ALSO REBOOT THE SYSTEM BY AN ALTERNATE METHOD DESCRIBED BELOW WHILE
 1045                 /       STILL RESTORING THE PREVIOUS WORD.  [CODE SPACE CAN BE OBTAINED BY OTHER
 1046                 /       RELATED METHODS IN A VIABLE OVERALL SOLUTION.]
 1047   
 1048   007676* 0000  RDQUAD, .-.                             /READ A 12-BIT WORD FROM THE DECTAPE ROUTINE.
 1049   007677* 6773          SDSQ                            /QUAD LINE FLAG UP?
 1050   007700* 5277          JMP     .-1                     /NO, WAIT FOR IT.
 1051   007701* 6777          SDRD                            /YES, READ IN THE LATEST 12-BIT WORD.
 1052   007702* 6272          CIF     ROMFLD                  /GOING TO ROM FIELD.
 1053   007703* 5676          JMP I   RDQUAD                  /RETURN TO CALLER.
 1054   
 1055   007704* 6364  EQUFUN, 6364/.-.                        /EQUIVALENCE DATA WITH CHECKSUM ROUTINE.
 1056   007705* 7040          CMA                             /INVERT THE DATA AND ,XOR. THE DATA WORD.
 1057   007706* 3350          DCA     EQUTMP                  /SAVE IT.
 1058   007707* 1350          TAD     EQUTMP                  /GET IT BACK.
 1059   007710* 0333          AND     SCKSUM                  /GET THE CARRY BITS.
 1060   007711* 7041          CIA                             /INVERT FOR SUBTRACTION.
 1061   007712* 7104          CLL RAL                         /MOVE OVER.
 1062   007713* 1350          TAD     EQUTMP                  /NOW ADD THE LATEST.
 1063   007714* 1333          TAD     SCKSUM                  /ADD THE NON-CARRY BITS TO RUNNING SUM.
 1064   007715* 3333          DCA     SCKSUM                  /STORE BACK.
 1065   007716* 1350          TAD     EQUTMP                  /GET THE LATEST DATA BACK.
 1066   007717* 7140          CLL CMA                         /NOW HAVE CLEAR LINK AND THE LATEST WORD.
 1067   007720* 6272          CIF     ROMFLD                  /GOING TO ROM FIELD.
 1068   007721* 5704          JMP I   EQUFUN                  /RETURN TO CALLER.


