 1876                                                         /SIZE RELOADER CODE IMAGE.
 1877   
 1878           4043          IMAGEND=.                       /FIRST LOCATION AFTER ACTUAL RELOADER IMAGE.
 1879   
 1880           0135          IM=ICOREND-IMAGEND              /COUNT OF ADDITIONAL WORDS AVAILABLE.
 1881   
 1882                         IFNZRO  IM&4000 <ERROR  .>      /ENSURE CODE LIMIT NOT EXCEEDED.


